04:40.800 --> 04:43.950
So we could always do git pull origin main

04:43.950 --> 04:45.840
although there's nothing new up there

04:45.840 --> 04:47.010
we're already up to date.

04:47.010 --> 04:48.960
But now I can make my branch

04:48.960 --> 04:51.376
