05:13.680 --> 05:17.220
Like you wouldn't commit that just a single html element.

05:17.220 --> 05:18.540
But I will here.

05:18.540 --> 05:20.250
So git add index

05:20.250 --> 05:22.162
and then I'll do git commit,

05:22.162 --> 05:25.800
add container to index.

05:25.800 --> 05:29.430
Okay, now let's do another commit where,

05:29.430 --> 05:31.950
