12:09.390 --> 12:12.240
Alright, fast forward 'cause there's a new commit.

12:12.240 --> 12:14.940
If we type git log, we see the whole history here.

12:14.940 --> 12:18.900
Most recently we have Colt, fixed Navbar Bug.

12:18.900 --> 12:21.420
